# What Cloud Build must never receive.
#
# Without this file gcloud falls back to .gitignore, which is a different
# question: .gitignore answers "what should not be in version control", and
# this answers "what should not be uploaded to a build server". They overlap
# but they are not the same list — tests and docs belong in git and have no
# business in a container build.

.git/
.gitignore
node_modules/

# Secrets. Belt and braces: .env is gitignored too, but a build upload is the
# wrong place to find out that a rule was missing.
.env
.env.*

# Not needed at runtime. The server serves its own HTML from src/.
landing/
docs/
*.md
!README.md

# Tests and tooling never run in the image.
**/*.test.ts
mutate.sh
skills-lock.json
